<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fed One cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fed One cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it reduced its rating on Fed One Bancorp Inc to hold due to price.</p>
<p>-- introduced 1998 earnings estimate of $1.55 per share.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 17-3/4 on Friday.</p>
</text>
